I don't believe FILE_OFFSET_BITS influence on the driver or alsa-lib
behavior.

It's not guaranteed to work if you use plughw.  It's nearly a raw access.
For accessing SPDIF, use "spdif" instead (for ice1724, "plug:spdif").

